WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.980
How many damaged copies are needed?

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.775
Each copy loses random bits. How many copies recover the original?

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.339
Two strings nested scale after scale become nearly impossible to tell apart.

4
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.631
Claimed: more copies than any polynomial allows.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.684
Lean checks only part.
